  "notes": [
    "Recorded from @modelcontextprotocol/server-everything 2026.8.31 on @modelcontextprotocol/sdk 1.32.2 (local, no credentials); behavior that can't be replayed is computed in src/fauxcall_everything from the recordings and the server's published source.",
    "From the SDK source, not recorded (the recorder can't open a fresh session per initialize): an unsupported protocol version is answered with LATEST_PROTOCOL_VERSION 2025-11-25 (server/index.js); 2024-10-07 is supported (also named in the recorded protocol-header refusal, 000016).",
    "From the SDK source, not recorded: transport.timeout_cancel_reason (McpError string of a -32001 timeout) and resumption=session (the server's InMemoryEventStore replays every later event of the session).",
    "on_cancel=finish from recordings: a cancelled gzip still registered its resource (000256, 000259); progress continued after a cancel (000249). Tools that check their abort signal through extra.sendRequest (the async tools, tasks/result) stop at their next request (000530).",
    "requires per tool and the tool order from tools/list per declared client capability (000039-000045, 000310-000375); simulate-research-query requires [[]]: offered to every client, but only after notifications/initialized.",
    "Dynamic resources print the server host's local time (America/New_York, recorded 23:54 UTC as 7:54:20 PM).",
    "gzip-file-as-resource never reaches the network: data: URLs are compressed (Node-identical bytes, 000159-000166), the default README comes from 000260, any other http(s) URL answers 'fetch failed' like an unreachable host (000172)."
  ]
}